<title>NETHERLANDS: Van Ommeren breakdown of operating profit.</title>
<headline>Van Ommeren breakdown of operating profit.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shipping and tank storage firm Koninklijke van Ommeren NV gave the following breakdown of its 1996 operating profits (in millions of guilders):</p>
<p>TANK STORAGE</p>
<p>   - Europe				 49.2  vs   53.9</p>
<p>   - America				14.6  vs   18.8</p>
<p>   - Asia				   19.9  vs   18.9</p>
<p>   - Total				  83.7  vs   91.6</p>
<p>TANKER SHIPPING</p>
<p>   - Ocean tanker shipping	    16.1  vs   14.8</p>
<p>   - Inland tanker shipping	   29.9  vs   12.8</p>
<p>   - Total				  46.0  vs   27.6</p>
<p>TRANSPORT SERVICES</p>
<p>   - Dry-cargo shipping		 24.9  vs   33.0</p>
<p>   - Other transport services	 11.0  vs    6.8</p>
<p>   - Total				  35.9  vs   39.8</p>
<p>  UNATTRIBUTED REVENUE		   1.6  vs    6.7 cost</p>
<p>TOTAL GROUP OPERATING PROFIT	 167.2  vs  152.3 (restated)</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
